From 8769b50bd7b82836b00a3492fc86dc102cd55b8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: netplay <netplay@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:30:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add lockstep netplay module and DDR mailbox channel

- rtl/netplay.sv: frame tick on emulated scanline, two-entry INPUT lookahead,
  pause request on missing input, LOCAL/CRC/STATUS posts, CTRL polling
- rtl/ddram.sv: second channel for the netplay mailbox at 0x3C000000; read
  data is no longer dropped when DDRAM_BUSY is high
- rtl/nes.v: export emulated-time scanline and ppu_ce
- NES.sv: wire netplay in; ports 1/2 from mailbox, cheats, savestates,
  OSD pause and multitap disabled while active
- sim/: Verilator testbench with two simulated machines (make -C sim test)
